ALVA — Adamaris Stage & Gameplay Update

Objective

Implement a major update to ALVA, introducing a new playable stage called Adamaris, renaming two existing stages, updating the match timer and credits, and creating a dramatic new Void elimination ripple effect.

This is an implementation task, not a proposal. Inspect the existing systems, write the code, integrate everything into the game, update the documentation and tests, and verify that the features work.

Repository: https://github.com/hiyroscript/alva

Follow the existing project’s architecture, visual direction, code conventions, collision rules, and gameplay systems. Preserve existing functionality unless explicitly changed below.

ALVA is a browser-based 2D platform fighter using JavaScript, HTML, CSS, and Canvas 2D with procedural pseudo-3D stage artwork. Do not introduce a new game engine, rendering framework, or unnecessary dependencies.

